{
  "durationInFrames": 1592,
  "segments": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Stop trying to hit 10,000 steps.",
      "audioFile": "vo_0.mp3",
      "startFrame": 0,
      "durationInFrames": 97,
      "endFrame": 97
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Doctors say it's not the number that matters.",
      "audioFile": "vo_1.mp3",
      "startFrame": 97,
      "durationInFrames": 93,
      "endFrame": 190
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Large studies found the health benefits start climbing well before 10,000, and they begin to level off around 7,000 steps a day.",
      "audioFile": "vo_2.mp3",
      "startFrame": 190,
      "durationInFrames": 243,
      "endFrame": 433
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "That's roughly 30 to 40 minutes of walking.",
      "audioFile": "vo_3.mp3",
      "startFrame": 433,
      "durationInFrames": 100,
      "endFrame": 533
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "But here's the trick almost nobody uses: walk for just 10 minutes after your biggest meal.",
      "audioFile": "vo_4.mp3",
      "startFrame": 533,
      "durationInFrames": 170,
      "endFrame": 703
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "It helps your body handle the sugar spike from that meal, which is better for your energy and your heart.",
      "audioFile": "vo_5.mp3",
      "startFrame": 703,
      "durationInFrames": 175,
      "endFrame": 878
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "So your plan is simple.",
      "audioFile": "vo_6.mp3",
      "startFrame": 878,
      "durationInFrames": 70,
      "endFrame": 948
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Seven thousand steps a day.",
      "audioFile": "vo_7.mp3",
      "startFrame": 948,
      "durationInFrames": 79,
      "endFrame": 1027
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Ten minutes after dinner.",
      "audioFile": "vo_8.mp3",
      "startFrame": 1027,
      "durationInFrames": 65,
      "endFrame": 1092
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "That's it.",
      "audioFile": "vo_9.mp3",
      "startFrame": 1092,
      "durationInFrames": 57,
      "endFrame": 1149
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "No gym, no app, no money.",
      "audioFile": "vo_10.mp3",
      "startFrame": 1149,
      "durationInFrames": 93,
      "endFrame": 1242
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "Save this, and tonight after dinner, go for a walk.",
      "audioFile": "vo_11.mp3",
      "startFrame": 1242,
      "durationInFrames": 122,
      "endFrame": 1364
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "Want to know why 10,000 steps became the standard in the first place?",
      "audioFile": "vo_12.mp3",
      "startFrame": 1364,
      "durationInFrames": 135,
      "endFrame": 1499
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "It wasn't science...",
      "audioFile": "vo_13.mp3",
      "startFrame": 1499,
      "durationInFrames": 63,
      "endFrame": 1562
    }
  ]
}